steps.description:
Create packages/mull/src/server/types.ts. Define:

1) MullServiceConfig interface following the codebase ServiceConfig pattern:
   { plannerDbPath: string, forgeDbPath: string, relayDataDir: string, memoryDir: string, includeUserTrajectory?: boolean, includePreferences?: boolean, relayMode?: 'jsonl' | 'sqlite' }

2) Zod schemas for API validation:
   - RunRequestSchema: discriminated union on 'type' field:
     z.discriminatedUnion('type', [
       z.object({ type: z.literal('planner-trajectory'), planId: z.string() }),
       z.object({ type: z.literal('forge-run'), runId: z.string() }),
       z.object({ type: z.literal('relay-session'), sessionId: z.string() }),
     ]).and(z.object({ force: z.boolean().optional(), dryRun: z.boolean().optional() }))
   - RunAllRequestSchema: { force?: boolean, dryRun?: boolean }
   - TopicQuerySchema: { slug: z.string() }

3) MullService interface: { router: Router, initialize(): Promise<void>, shutdown(): Promise<void>, getAdapterStatus(): AdapterStatus[] }
